by shower bingo is created equal — some variations are far more fun than others."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"After helping thousands of hosts plan their baby showers, we've identified the 7 best baby shower bingo games that guests consistently rave about. Each variation puts a unique twist on the classic format."}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"1. Gift Bingo (The Classic)"}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"How it works:"}]," Before the shower, create bingo cards with common baby gifts in each square — diapers, onesies, pacifiers, baby blankets, etc. As the mom-to-be opens gifts, guests mark off matching items on their cards."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Why guests love it:"}]," It transforms gift opening — often the longest part of a shower — into an exciting, competitive game. Instead of passively watching, everyone is actively engaged."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Pro tip:"}]," Include both obvious items (diapers, wipes) and specific ones (baby thermometer, white noise machine) to keep the game balanced."]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"2. Baby Word Bingo"}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"How it works:"}]," Cards feature baby-related vocabulary — \"nursery,\" \"lullaby,\" \"swaddle,\" \"teething,\" etc. A caller draws words from a bowl and reads them aloud."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Why guests love it:"}]," It's fast-paced, easy to understand, and great for groups where not everyone knows each other. The caller format keeps energy high."]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"3. Baby Prediction Bingo"}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"How it works:"}]," Each square has a prediction about the baby — \"born before due date,\" \"over 7 pounds,\" \"has mom's eyes,\" \"first word is dada,\" etc. Guests mark which ones they think will come true."]}],"$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23"]}],"$L24"]}]}]}]
